==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 6000 series|6000 series]] (6-car sets):
*: The exclusive rolling stock for the Tedorigawa Line. These trains feature a stainless steel body with a dark brown band, symbolizing the rich soil of the riverbanks. They are equipped with large windows to allow passengers to view the riverside scenery during the few at-grade sections near the port.

